Hi,

Currently acpidump EFI version can be compiled using the following command:
# make OS=3Defi
It is currently based on GNU EFI, for different distributions, the GNU EFI =
related CFLAGS/LDFLAGS may need to be changed in generic/efi/Makefile.confi=
g.

And with this commit merged:
https://github.com/zetalog/acpica/commit/faedf900
This tool should be easily ported to other EFI implementations (for example=
, EDK).

Thanks and best regards
-Lv

